# Backend

- Routes: `server/src/index.ts` and focused `*Routes.ts`. Validate with limits from `shared/`.
- Product FFmpeg exports go through `jobs.ts` (one encode at a time). Do not start a parallel FFmpeg pipeline.
- Image Upscaler uses `imageUpscalerJobs.ts` (separate from FFmpeg queue).
- Use `ffmpegUtil.ts`, `encoders.ts`, `ffmpegThreading.ts` for spawn/progress/encode helpers.
- Temp data only under `server/tmp/` (gitignored). Clips/frames/outputs are caches, not editor source of truth.
- Never commit secrets or write API tokens into source. Optional AI Lite config stays in env / `docs/image-upscaler.md`.
